写入文件的纯净度）。\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def __init__(\n        self,\n\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 10051, "output_tokens": 161, "total_tokens": 10212}, "is_final_answer": false}}
