f __init__(\n        self,\n"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}], "tool_calls": [], "error": {"type": "AgentParsingError", "message": "Error in code parsing:\nYour code snippet is invalid, because the regex pattern ```python(.*?)``` was not found in it.\n            Here is your code snippet:\n\n\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ calls>\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ invoke name=\"update_plan\">\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter name=\"items\" string=\"false\">[{\"title\": \"Read required source files\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"Run baseline pytest\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"Implement environ.py config\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"Implement logger.py formatter budget\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"Implement stats_logger.py extra\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"Run final pytest and verify\", \"status\": \"todo\"}]</｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜ invoke>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜ calls>```\n            Make sure to include code with the correct pattern, for instance:\n            Thoughts: Your thoughts\n            ```python\n            # Your python code here\n            ```\nMake sure to provide correct code blobs."}, "model_output_message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "\n\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ calls>\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ invoke name=\"update_plan\">\n<｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter name=\"items\" string=\"false\">[{\"title\": \"Read required source files\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"Run baseline pytest\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"Implement environ.py config\", \"status\": \"doing\"}, {\"title\": \"Implement logger.py formatter budget\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"Implement stats_logger.py extra\", \"status\": \"todo\"}, {\"title\": \"Run final pytest and verify\", \"status\": \"todo\"}]</｜｜DSML｜｜ parameter>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜ invoke>\n</｜｜DSML｜｜ calls>```", "tool_calls": null, "raw": {"_type": "ChatCompletion", "id": "fa9646c7-9faa-44e5-b680-590cedbcee65", "choices": [{"_type": "Choice", "finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "logprobs": null, "message": {"_